# Quick manual API checks. In Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client), click "Send Request".
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
# Paste real ids here: classId from "List classes", holdId from "Apply for a seat".
@classId = c_replace_me
@student = 20152691234567890
@otherStudent = 20159999999999999
@holdId = h_replace_me

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create a class -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Class 6 - Morning Shift", "totalSeats": 120 }

### Same name again (case/space-insensitive) -> 409 CLASS_NAME_TAKEN
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "  class 6 -  morning shift ", "totalSeats": 50 }

### Invalid body -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "totalSeats": 0 }

### Wrong type -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Class 7 - Day Shift", "totalSeats": "many" }

### List classes with seat counts -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes

### One class -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}

### Unknown class -> 404 CLASS_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/c_does_not_exist

# ======================= Holds (applications) =======================

### Apply for a seat -> 201 HELD (copy "holdId" into @holdId at the top)
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: {{student}}

### Apply again, same student + class -> 409 ACTIVE_HOLD_EXISTS
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: {{student}}

### Missing header -> 400 STUDENT_ID_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds

### Wrong format -> 400 STUDENT_ID_INVALID
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: 12345

### Hold status -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/holds/{{holdId}}

### My applications -> 200 (array, newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/holds
X-Student-Id: {{student}}

### Another student tries to pay -> 403 HOLD_NOT_OWNED
POST {{baseUrl}}/holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
X-Student-Id: {{otherStudent}}

### Pay fee -> 200 CONFIRMED
POST {{baseUrl}}/holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
X-Student-Id: {{student}}

### Pay again -> 200 CONFIRMED (idempotent, confirmedSeats does not change)
POST {{baseUrl}}/holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
X-Student-Id: {{student}}

### Cancel a confirmed admission -> 409 HOLD_ALREADY_CONFIRMED
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/holds/{{holdId}}
X-Student-Id: {{student}}

### Cancel (use a HELD hold id) -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/holds/{{holdId}}
X-Student-Id: {{student}}
